WEBVTT

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:05.510
I’m such a horrible person.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.340
I led Kin-chan on...

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:13.020
But, the words that came out of me then were “Irie-kun”.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:18.200
I worried over it, and then decided to give up, and yet...

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:23.460
I guess Irie-kun is the only one for me.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.150
Hey.

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:33.260
Irie-kun?

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:35.240
What’s wrong?

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.850
Why are you in the rain?

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:41.350
I was waiting for you.

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:45.360
Waiting for me?

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:02.060
Irie-kun seems different.

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:05.240
Were you meeting with Kinnosuke?

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.000
I heard that he proposed to you.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.950
He did.

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:13.960
I’m not totally unwanted, you know?

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:16.650
So, how did you answer?

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:19.390
It’s none of your business how I answered, now, is it?

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:21.770
I guess not.

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:28.130
I’ll be moving out, okay?

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:29.520
I decided with Dad.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:32.950
Otherwise, I’d get in the way of your marriage, right?

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:35.240
I’ll marry Kin-chan.

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:38.560
Then, everything will go well, right?

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:43.030
You’ll marry Chris, and I’ll marry Kin-chan.

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:44.780
And I’ll help at Dad’s shop.

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:46.830
Do you love him?

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:49.780
Of course I do!

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:54.370
Because Kin-chan has loved me since freshman year of high school!

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:57.590
Do you fall in love with people who tell you that they love you?

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:58.880
Is that bad?

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:01.680
I’m tired of this five year long one-sided love!

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:05.180
Why don’t you just think about Chris?

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:06.430
Forget about me!

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:08.130
You love me!

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:10.020
You won’t be able to love anyone else!

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.030
Why are you so confident?

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:22.350
That’s right!

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:23.790
It’s exactly as you say!

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:27.280
But, what choice do I have?

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:29.540
You don’t love me.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.600
You don’t care about me.

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:48.480
It’s because you...

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:52.610
Don’t tell me that you love any other man.

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.100
Irie-kun...

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:00.310
This is the second time.

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:01.940
What is?

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:03.120
That you kissed me.

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:05.200
This is the third time, isn’t it?

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.500
But...

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.080
You don’t have to count anymore.

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:14.940
Is this a dream?

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:20.110
If it is, then I want to continue sleeping.

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:20.920
Kotoko.

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:23.930
Let’s go home.

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.350
Irie-kun?

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:36.360
Aihara-san, must you leave?

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.890
Yes, Kotoko and I decided together.

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:43.740
We’d only bring you hardships if we stayed any longer.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.280
Never!

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:49.830
What happened? You’re both soaking wet.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.800
I’ll bring the towels.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:54.910
Oji-san.

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:55.840
Yes?

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.220
We have to talk.

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:00.400
What is it?

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:04.010
Please let me marry your daughter, Kotoko-san.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.680
Are you being serious?!

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:15.110
I’m serious. I finally understand that I want to marry Kotoko.

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:19.400
Obviously not right away, but probably after we graduate.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:22.210
And I have to have Chris understand first.

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:27.740
But, I can’t imagine a future with anyone else but Kotoko.

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:29.370
Irie-kun...

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:32.710
Oji-san, can we have your blessing?

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.340
Naoki-kun...

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:39.120
She can’t do anything right.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:39.820
I know.

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:41.620
She’s also not very smart.

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:42.680
I know.

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:44.430
And she can’t cook either.

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.490
I know.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:48.600
Always making mistakes because she carelessly jumps to conclusions.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.620
I know.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:56.070
But she’s lively, strong-willed, single-minded, and adorable!

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:57.270
I know.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:01.390
Naoki-kun, please take care of Kotoko.

00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:02.850
I will.

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:04.710
Can I, Kotoko?

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.470
Well said, Onii-chan!

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:14.250
Do you know how long Mama has been dreaming and waiting for this day?

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:17.830
Video! I have to get a video of this!

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:22.190
My head has become completely blank...

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:25.260
...and I can no longer tell if this is a dream or reality.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:29.210
Irie-kun wants to marry me?

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:32.350
This has to be a dream after all...

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:33.340
She’s feeling light headed.

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:34.290
Kotoko!

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:36.710
Are you all right?

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:39.970
Then, sweet dreams.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.190
What is it?

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:50.820
I just feel that if you go into your room, you’ll return to being the mean Irie-kun in the morning.

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:52.620
Then, do you want to sleep in the same bed?

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.910
That’s not what I meant!

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:55.750
Of course not.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.450
It feels like the whole house would be listening in tonight anyway.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:01.950
Hey, are you sure about choosing me?

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:05.470
Yeah, I think you’ve turned me
into a masochist.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:08.600
I love you, Irie-kun!

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.800
I know that very well.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:15.690
But, I never knew that you loved me too.

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:18.530
I just gave into you.

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:22.140
I love you.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.080
Mama, would you please cut it out?

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:37.460
Really?

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:41.460
I’ll deal with the marriage interview issue myself, so...

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:44.090
Don’t worry about that.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:44.970
Dad.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:48.910
Don’t worry about me or the company.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:51.520
Kotoko-chan, please take care of Naoki.

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:52.670
I will!

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:58.420
You’re marrying Irie?!

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:01.610
Oh no! Did you eat something funny?

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:03.660
I’ve had enough of your jokes.

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:06.010
How rude. It’s the truth.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:06.920
Seriously?

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:11.770
Well, not right away,
but maybe after graduation.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:12.980
I can’t believe it.

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:15.030
Miracles really do exist!

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:17.760
How did you melt Irie’s ice?

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:21.700
Well, you can do anything if you put your mind to it.

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:24.660
I’ll make you the model of hope for my life!

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:26.250
Well, anyway...

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.230
Congratulations!

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:29.440
You did it, Kotoko!

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:30.730
Good for you!

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:31.510
Thank you!

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:35.050
But, what are you going to do about that fiancée of his?

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.470
And there’s also Kin-chan too.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:41.610
Irie-kun will explain things to Chris.

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:45.030
I’ll have to tell Kin-chan myself.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.880
Marriage; what a surprise!

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:52.680
And it’s Aihara-san with Irie-kun too.

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.500
You never know what can happen in life.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.230
Can’t get married?

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:08.490
I’m not expecting you to forgive me.

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:13.690
But, I can no longer continue
to deceive myself.

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:15.470
It’s Kotoko, isn’t it?

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:21.540
I feel that I was being selfish.

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.520
I think it’s only natural for me
to take the blame.

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:26.900
You sure are honest, Naoki.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.400
I’m envious.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:33.570
Very well then, I’ll talk to my father.

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:34.580
Chris.

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:39.890
I’m glad to have met you. Bye-bye.

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:47.470
Hey, Kin-chan...

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:50.160
Ah, so busy, so busy!

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:51.870
I’m so busy, really.

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:53.800
Kin-chan, we have to talk.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:58.920
I’m sorry, but I’m incredibly busy right now. I have my hands full.

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:00.210
Next time, maybe.

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:02.750
It’s okay, Kinnosuke-san, I can do it.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.020
No one asked for your help!

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:09.120
Kotoko, I’m sorry, but can you go home?

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:10.260
Kinnosuke.

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:12.270
Irie-kun?

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:13.660
We have to talk.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:17.240
I have nothing to talk about with you!

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.740
You’re disturbing my work.
Hurry and go home.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.440
I’m taking Kotoko.

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:25.050
It may be a bad thing to do to you,
but I’m marrying Kotoko.

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:29.290
Don’t say stupid things!

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:32.970
You’ve always been so cold towards Kotoko! It’s a bit late for you to talk!

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:35.510
I’ll never allow such a thing!

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:38.470
I’ve been devoted to Kotoko for the last five years...

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.930
Kin-chan... Kin-chan, I’m sorry!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:44.800
I... I love Irie-kun after all...

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:49.430
I know. It doesn’t matter
whether I allow it or not.

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:52.480
You’ve always been in love with Irie after all.

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:57.730
You really have a bad eye for men.

00:09:57.730 --> 00:09:59.510
I’m not going to care if you regret your choice.

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:00.950
Kin-chan...

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:03.490
Irie, make sure you make Kotoko happy!

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:05.580
I really won’t forgive you if you don’t!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:09.250
If he makes you cry even just a little, I’ll always be on standby!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.260
Yeah, I know.

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:14.760
Kin-chan, thank you.

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:18.210
Okay, thank you very much.
You can go home now.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:24.540
Kinnosuke, well said! You were very manly.

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:26.020
I have a better opinion of you now, Kinnosuke!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.520
No, Kotoko!

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:33.830
Okay, we’re going to have a commiseration party for Kinnosuke tonight!

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:36.720
Yeah. Shall we close the shop and go for some drinks?

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:38.950
Boss!

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.540
I’m sorry!

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.060
Cheer up, okay?

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:46.230
I wanted to call you “Dad”!

00:10:46.230 --> 00:10:49.240
Dad!

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:53.510
We sure did hurt a lot of people.

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:56.770
We wouldn’t have been able to accomplish anything if we kept worrying about such things, right?

00:10:56.770 --> 00:10:58.440
We have to overcome those things.

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:00.510
That’s true, but...

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:04.810
Well, we don’t know what will come of us in the future either.

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:09.720
Really?

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:12.620
Yes, he’s not home yet.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:14.110
He hasn’t called either.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:16.670
Anyway, I’ll make some inquiries.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.290
What’s wrong?

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:23.830
Papa has disappeared from the hospital!

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:35.790
I’m really sorry.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:39.200
Naoki acted on his own.

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:41.040
If there’s anything we can do
to make up for it...

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:44.890
I heard from Chris.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:50.050
Mr. Irie, do you want the loan from my bank or not?

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:53.050
Well, I do, but...

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:55.810
What do you not like about Chris?!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:58.160
What does she lack?!

00:11:58.160 --> 00:11:59.650
She doesn’t lack anything.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:00.150
What?

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:03.950
Naoki! Why are you here?

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:07.190
Chris is a perfect young woman.

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:09.950
Then, why won’t you marry her?!

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:15.110
My explanation may be filled with flaws, but there’s a girl I love more than Chris.

00:12:16.510 --> 00:12:20.110
I understand the consequences of turning down the marriage proposal.

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:22.170
As well as the wrongdoings against my father.

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:23.540
Naoki.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:30.170
However, if I deceive my own feelings and marry Chris, it’ll not only be betraying her, but myself too.

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:34.650
No one would be happy if I did such a thing.

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:36.870
I’m sorry!

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:37.740
Kotoko.

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:40.360
I know that I’m being selfish.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:43.020
I’m a terrible person for hurting others.

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.490
But, I just couldn’t give up.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:51.740
I’ve always loved Irie-kun. Always.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:55.040
That’s why... I’m truly sorry!

00:12:56.590 --> 00:12:58.900
There’s no reason to apologize.

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:02.630
Chris.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:06.640
To be honest,
I didn’t want to get married either.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:10.210
That’s why I was relieved when Naoki turned down the offer.

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:14.840
Papa!

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:18.310
I have someone else I’m in love with.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:23.170
I’ve finally met the man I’m fated to be with.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.350
Robbins-san, are you all right?

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:40.840
Kotoko, Naoki. May you find happiness.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.710
I will find love too!

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:48.630
Sorry for the trouble.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.960
Are you feeling all right?

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:51.650
Yeah.

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:55.130
I’m sorry. It’s all because of me.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.140
Don’t worry about it.

00:13:57.140 --> 00:14:00.860
Then Oji-sama, please get lots of rest.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:02.570
Ah, thanks.

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:14.590
That’s good. You managed to get everyone to understand.

00:14:14.590 --> 00:14:17.120
Yeah. Sorry for making you guys worry.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:20.500
Now you just have to make sure that Irie doesn’t run away.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.090
We’ll be fine.

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:23.760
I wonder about that.

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:28.730
It’ll definitely be all right...
I think... Probably...

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:30.130
Kotoko!

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:35.210
I came here to give my thanks.

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:36.130
Thanks?

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:41.390
Up until now, I thought it was only natural to obey your parents.

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:44.610
But, I came to a realization after watching you and Naoki.

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:48.110
That, you should decide your own path in life.

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:50.490
Chris...

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:53.610
Thank you, Kotoko.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:58.870
Say, what kind of guy is this guy that you like?

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:02.850
A very sexy and handsome person.

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:05.130
Men have to be handsome.

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.820
Oh, you’re attracted by physical looks.

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:11.630
Actually, I really don’t like guys like Naoki.

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:18.290
It was hard for me to tell you because he’s the person you chose.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:22.220
But, you really have bad taste in men.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.110
He’s so cute and sexy, isn’t he?

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:35.840
Hold it right there.

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:37.860
Don’t tell me that the person you like is...

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:41.070
Yes! I’ve finally met the man
I’m fated to be with!

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:44.330
Kinnosuke is the handsomest man on the planet, isn’t he?

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.050
Well, I’m not so sure about that.

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:52.030
Oh, you’re handsome-challenged so you wouldn’t understand.

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:52.800
Poor girl.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:56.050
Kinnosuke!

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:58.550
What, you’re here again?

00:15:58.550 --> 00:16:01.020
Yes, I’ve come again.

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:02.840
And, your order?

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:04.810
Yes, Kinnosuke please.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:08.810
Huh? I just don’t understand jokes from English people.

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:11.290
It’s not a joke!

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:13.810
Kinnosuke, marry me!

00:16:18.690 --> 00:16:20.040
Cheers!

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:23.810
Congratulations on your discharge.

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:25.280
Thank you.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:28.620
Thank goodness, Iri-chan.

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:31.500
You’re still recovering so don’t exert yourself.

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:33.740
I’m afraid that’s not possible.

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:35.550
I have to start work right away tomorrow.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:38.760
Lots of work has piled up
while I was hospitalized.

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:41.130
I’ll help.

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:44.520
But, what about school?

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:46.730
I’ll quit the Medical Department.

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:50.280
I’ll join Dad’s company.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:53.380
You already gave me your blessing to marry Kotoko.

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:56.770
I can’t possibly demand more.

00:16:57.590 --> 00:16:58.900
Irie-kun...

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.490
Naoki, don’t think so lowly of me.

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:08.320
Even without your help, I’ll get the company back on its feet.

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:10.370
Please do what you wish to do.

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:11.320
But!

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:13.510
I’ll succeed Papa’s company.

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:19.090
Succeed the company? But, you’re still in elementary school, Yuuki.

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:22.010
Stupid! I’m talking about the future.

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:24.270
Papa will just have to work hard until then.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.270
Yuuki!

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:29.670
So, Onii-chan, become a doctor.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:33.500
And treat those who are
suffering like Non-chan.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.690
It’s not being selfish.

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:42.690
I’m sure there are many people who want you to treat them.

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:45.250
Is it really all right?

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:48.200
Yeah, a man won’t let anything stand in his way.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:52.580
Then, please allow me to do so.

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:58.100
Thank goodness! My home is filled with nothing but great men! Right, Kotoko-chan?

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:00.000
Yes, Oba-sama!

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:05.990
Oh yeah. Everyone, please free up your Sunday two weeks from now.

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:09.310
Was there something going on next Sunday?

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:12.430
Onii-chan and Kotoko-chan’s
wedding ceremony!

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:14.860
Wedding ceremony?!

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:16.810
What kind of joke are you trying to pull?

00:18:16.810 --> 00:18:19.980
Good things should be hurried, right?

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:23.960
Besides, if we wait until you graduate, you might change your mind.

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:25.030
That could really happen.

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:27.490
I reserved the wedding hall under Papa’s name.

00:18:27.490 --> 00:18:30.300
Kotoko-chan, let’s start the bridal beauty treatment tomorrow, okay?

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:33.750
We’ve gotta choose a wedding dress, and make a list of guests!

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:37.720
And we’ve also gotta decide on gifts.
Ah, so busy!

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:44.590
There’s a limit to how sudden it can be.

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:48.570
It’s only been two weeks since then.

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:51.100
Mama Irie is not to be taken lightly.

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:55.100
So beautiful!

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:57.060
You’re so beautiful, Kotoko-chan!

00:18:57.060 --> 00:18:59.860
My daughter, Kotoko-chan!

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:03.210
I’m starting to get nervous...

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.030
What are you scared of?

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:07.830
Don’t mess up your wedding vows.

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:09.830
Now that you mention it,
it might really happen.

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:14.810
Kotoko, to celebrate your marriage, I’m going to tell you something really good.

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:16.140
What is it?

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:17.460
You know, that time...

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:26.720
The bridegroom is really handsome.

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:28.610
But, he doesn’t look too happy though.

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:30.800
Isn’t he just nervous?

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:42.300
Kotoko is so beautiful...

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:48.020
Naoki-kun, please take care of Kotoko.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:48.930
I will.

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:52.350
Irie-kun, you’re angry, aren’t you?

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:54.580
Well, this was pushed forward without my consent.

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:59.540
But, since you’re so beautiful, I don’t care any more.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:05.050
Irie Naoki, do you take Aihara Kotoko...

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:11.270
...in sickness and in health, to love, to honor and to serve, to be your lawfully wedded wife?

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:13.810
Yes, I do.

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:17.520
I’m Irie-kun’s bride.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:21.690
I’m going to be the wife of Irie-kun, the one whom I truly admire.

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:23.140
...as your lawfully wedded husband?

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:24.030
Hey.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:26.780
Yes, I do!

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:29.240
Now for the exchanging of the rings.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:38.160
That’s my right hand.
Geez, stop daydreaming.

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:40.160
Say, Irie-kun.

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.170
What is it?

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:44.170
You’ve loved me for a long time, haven’t you?

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:46.550
What are you so elated about?

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:49.410
I heard from Yuuki-kun.

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:52.300
The second kiss was
at Romance Village, wasn’t it?

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:54.520
Damn that kid.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:57.430
You were crazy about me too, weren’t you?

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:06.970
Whoa, the bride sure is daring.

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:08.690
Kotoko, well done!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.120
Serves you right.

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:15.690
You sure got me there.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:22.740
Thinking about it, it sure was a long road.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:27.590
There were days where I cried too, but the time I spent with Irie-kun...

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:30.020
...was so much fun despite his bullying.

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:34.650
Let’s stay together forever, okay?

00:23:08.520 --> 00:23:13.340
I, Aihara Kotoko, have finally become Irie-kun’s bride!

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:15.810
The wedding ceremony sure was wonderful.

00:23:15.810 --> 00:23:17.380
I told you never to talk about that!

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:19.890
Aww, don’t be embarrassed.

00:23:19.890 --> 00:23:22.590
We’re going to dreamy Hawaii today!

00:23:22.590 --> 00:23:26.690
Hi, I am Kotoko Irie desu.

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:28.850
I’m afraid to find out what’s going to happen.

00:23:28.850 --> 00:23:30.750
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:30.750 --> 00:23:32.230
Honeymoon Panic.

00:23:32.230 --> 00:23:34.200
We’re definitely going to be happy, right?
